      "content": "It's easy to talk about sacrifice when you aren't the one standing in the middle of the wreckage. A true leader doesn't just keep moving when they've failed this catastrophically. They take responsibility. They find a way to make it right. But how do you make it right when the damage is permanent? There is only one way to truly honor them, to show that I actually care about the cost of my mistakes... a way to finally pay the debt I owe them.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
